obs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5114311/jackson-harris","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Harris_(American_football)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jackson Harris (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Harris_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:23Z","intro":"Jackson Harris is an American college football wide receiver for the LSU Tigers. He previously played for the Stanford Cardinal and Hawaii Rainbow Warriors.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Harris attended Berkeley High School in Berkeley, California. As a senior, he had 73 receptions for a state-leading 1,492 receiving yards and 24 touchdowns. He committed to Stanford University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Harris played 2023 and 2024 at Stanford, appearing in nine games and had six receptions for 86 yards and a touchdown. After the 2024, season he entered the transfer portal and transferred to the University of Hawaiʻi at Mānoa. In his lone season at Hawaii in 2025, Harris was named first team All-Mountain West after recording 49 receptions for 963 yards and 12 touchdowns. After the season, he entered the transfer portal again and committed to Louisiana State University (LSU)."}]}}